<title>USA: Barnes &amp; Noble to enter pact with AOL - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Barnes &amp; Noble to enter pact with AOL - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barnes &amp; Noble is expected to announce today a major venture with America Online, the Wall Street Journal said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The pact would make Barnes &amp; Noble the exclusive bookseller on AOL and offer 30 percent discounts on hardcover book prices, the paper said, adding that the discount would be bigger than those Barnes &amp; Noble offers in its stores.</p>
<p>The report said Barnes &amp; Noble would offer a database of more than one million titles and offer quick delivery on about half a milion books.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
